  "Rating methodology": "Metodologi penarafan",
  "The criteria are public so that any trainer can work out why they hold the grade they hold, and any employer can judge how much weight to put on it.": "Kriteria ini diterbitkan kepada umum supaya mana-mana jurulatih boleh memahami sendiri mengapa gred mereka sedemikian, dan mana-mana majikan boleh menilai sejauh mana gred itu boleh dijadikan sandaran.",
